#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:216
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:463
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Support"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:231
msgid "Enable output"
msgstr "Activer la sortie"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:235
msgid "Show Last Updated date on enabled post types."
msgstr ""
"Afficher la date de dernière mise à jour sur les types de contenu activés."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:240
msgid "Automatic placement"
msgstr "Placement automatique"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:243
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:356
msgid "After content"
msgstr "Après le contenu"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:244
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:357
msgid "Before content"
msgstr "Avant le contenu"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:245
msgid "Before and after content"
msgstr "Avant et après le contenu"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:246
msgid "Manual only (template tag)"
msgstr "Manuel uniquement (balise de modèle)"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:248
msgid ""
"Use Manual to place output via the template tag in your theme. See the Usage"
" tab for examples."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez Manuel uniquement pour placer la sortie via la balise de modèle "
"dans votre thème. Consultez l'onglet Utilisation et Support pour des "
"exemples."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:252
msgid "Label template"
msgstr "Modèle d'étiquette"

#. translators: 1: literal %s token shown as code, 2: example label shown as
#. code
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:259
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Use %1$s where the date should appear, e.g. %2$s. Omit %1$s to show the "
"label with no date."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez %1$s là où la date doit apparaître, ex. %2$s. Omettez %1$s pour "
"afficher l'étiquette sans date."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:268
msgid "Date format source"
msgstr "Source du format de date"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:271
msgid "Use WordPress site date format"
msgstr "Utiliser le format de date du site WordPress"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:272
msgid "Use custom date format"
msgstr "Utiliser un format de date personnalisé"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:273
msgid "Relative (e.g. \"3 days ago\")"
msgstr "Relatif (p. ex. « il y a 3 jours »)"

#. translators: %s is a URL
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:279
#, php-format
msgid "Custom format uses PHP date format tokens. %s"
msgstr ""
"Le format personnalisé utilise les jetons de date PHP de WordPress. %s"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:280
msgid "Format reference"
msgstr "Référence de format"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:287
msgid "Custom date format"
msgstr "Format de date personnalisé"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:290
msgid "Only used when Date format source is set to Custom. Default: F j, Y"
msgstr ""
"Utilisé uniquement lorsque la Source du format de date est définie sur "
"Personnalisé. Par défaut : F j, Y"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:294
msgid "Visibility condition"
msgstr "Condition de visibilité"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:298
msgid "Only show when modified date differs from publish date."
msgstr ""
"Afficher uniquement lorsque la date de modification diffère de la date de "
"publication."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:303
msgid "Post type mode"
msgstr "Mode de type de contenu"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:306
msgid "Show only on selected post types"
msgstr "Afficher uniquement sur les types de contenu sélectionnés"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:307
msgid "Show on all public post types except selected"
msgstr "Afficher sur tous les types de contenu publics sauf les sélectionnés"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:312
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "Types de contenu"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:337
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Enregistrer les paramètres"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:346
msgid "Automatic Injection"
msgstr "Injection automatique"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:347
msgid ""
"When a placement mode other than Manual is selected, the plugin "
"automatically injects the last-updated label into singular post/page content"
" via the_content filter."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'un mode de placement autre que Manuel uniquement est sélectionné, le "
"plugin injecte automatiquement l'étiquette de dernière mise à jour dans le "
"contenu singulier article/page via le filtre the_content."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:351
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:352
msgid "Expected output position"
msgstr "Position de sortie attendue"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:356
msgid "Label appears below the post body."
msgstr "L'étiquette apparaît sous le corps de l'article."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:357
msgid "Label appears above the post body."
msgstr "L'étiquette apparaît au-dessus du corps de l'article."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:358
msgid "Before and after"
msgstr "Avant et après"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:358
msgid "Label appears both above and below the post body."
msgstr ""
"L'étiquette apparaît à la fois au-dessus et en dessous du corps de "
"l'article."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:359
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:446
msgid "Manual only"
msgstr "Manuel uniquement"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:359
msgid ""
"Nothing is injected automatically. Use the template tag below in your theme "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Rien n'est injecté automatiquement. Utilisez la balise de modèle ci-dessous "
"dans votre fichier de thème."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:363
msgid "Label Template"
msgstr "Modèle d'étiquette"

#. translators: %s is a literal %s token placeholder shown in code
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:368
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Label template setting controls the text displayed. Use %s as the date "
"placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Le paramètre Modèle d'étiquette contrôle le texte affiché. Utilisez %s comme"
" espace réservé pour la date."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:376
msgid "Template setting"
msgstr "Paramètre de modèle"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:377
msgid "Example frontend output"
msgstr "Exemple de sortie frontend"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:381
msgid "Updated March 28, 2026"
msgstr "Mis à jour le 28 mars 2026"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:382
msgid "Last checked: March 28, 2026"
msgstr "Dernière vérification : 28 mars 2026"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:383
msgid "Fresh content  (no date appended — displayed as-is)"
msgstr "Contenu à jour (sans date ajoutée — affiché tel quel)"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:387
msgid "Template Tags"
msgstr "Balises de modèle"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:388
msgid ""
"Use these PHP functions anywhere in your theme when placement is set to "
"Manual."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez ces fonctions PHP n'importe où dans votre thème lorsque le "
"placement est défini sur Manuel."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:391
msgid ""
"Echoes the rendered HTML directly. Use inside The Loop or pass a post ID."
msgstr ""
"Affiche le HTML rendu directement. Utilisez à l'intérieur de The Loop ou "
"passez un ID d'article."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:394
msgid "Expected HTML output:"
msgstr "Sortie HTML attendue :"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:398
msgid ""
"Returns the rendered HTML string instead of echoing. Useful for further "
"manipulation."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie la chaîne HTML rendue au lieu de l'afficher. Utile pour une "
"manipulation further."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:402
msgid "Date Format Reference"
msgstr "Référence des formats de date"

#. translators: %s is a URL
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:407
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When using a custom date format, the same PHP date tokens used by WordPress "
"apply. %s"
msgstr ""
"Lors de l'utilisation d'un format de date personnalisé, les mêmes jetons de "
"date PHP utilisés par WordPress s'appliquent. %s"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:408
msgid "View full format reference &rarr;"
msgstr "Voir la référence complète des formats &rarr;"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:413
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Jeton"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:413
msgid "Example output"
msgstr "Exemple de sortie"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:415
msgid "March 28, 2026"
msgstr "28 mars 2026"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:416
msgid "28/03/2026"
msgstr "28/03/2026"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:417
msgid "2026-03-28"
msgstr "2026-03-28"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:418
msgid "28 Mar 2026"
msgstr "28 mar 2026"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:422
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Questions Fréquentes"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:424
msgid "The label is not appearing on my posts."
msgstr "L'étiquette n'apparaît pas sur mes articles."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:426
msgid "Check that Enable output is ticked on the Settings tab."
msgstr "Vérifiez que Activer la sortie est coché dans l'onglet Paramètres."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:427
msgid ""
"Check that the post type (e.g. Post, Page) is selected in the Post types "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez que le type de contenu (ex. : Article, Page) est sélectionné dans "
"la liste des Types de contenu."

#. translators: %s is a setting name
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:432
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If %s is ticked, the label will only show when the article has been edited "
"after its original publish date."
msgstr ""
"Si %s est coché, l'étiquette ne s'affichera que lorsque l'article aura été "
"modifié après sa date de publication originale."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:433
msgid "Only show when modified date differs from publish date"
msgstr ""
"Afficher uniquement lorsque la date de modification diffère de la date de "
"publication"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:437
msgid ""
"If Automatic placement is set to Manual, nothing is injected automatically —"
" add the template tag to your theme."
msgstr ""
"Si le Placement automatique est défini sur Manuel, rien n'est injecté "
"automatiquement — ajoutez la balise de modèle à votre thème."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:440
msgid "How do I place the label exactly where I want it?"
msgstr "Comment placer l'étiquette exactement où je le souhaite ?"

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s are setting/function names
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set Automatic placement to %1$s on the Settings tab, then add %2$s in your "
"theme template wherever you want it to appear."
msgstr ""
"Définissez le Placement automatique sur %1$s dans l'onglet Paramètres, puis "
"ajoutez %2$s dans le modèle de votre thème où vous souhaitez que l'étiquette"
" apparaisse."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:452
msgid "Can I show just a static label with no date?"
msgstr "Puis-je afficher simplement une étiquette statique sans date ?"

#. translators: %s is a literal %s placeholder shown in code
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:457
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Yes. Remove %s from the Label template. The text will be output as-is with "
"no date appended."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Supprimez %s du Modèle d'étiquette. Le texte sera affiché tel quel sans"
" date ajoutée."

#. translators: %s is the URL to the plugin support forum on WordPress.org.
#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date-settings.php:468
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Need a hand? Visit the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">plugin support forum on WordPress.org</a> for help, bug reports"
" and feature requests."
msgstr ""
"Besoin d'aide ? Visitez le <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">forum de support du plugin sur WordPress.org</a> pour obtenir "
"de l'aide, signaler des bugs et demander des fonctionnalités."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date.php:167
msgid ""
"Enjoying MSC: Post Last Updated Date? A quick review would really help other"
" WordPress users find it."
msgstr ""
"Vous appréciez MSC: Date de dernière mise à jour de l'article ? Un avis "
"rapide aiderait vraiment les autres utilisateurs de WordPress à le trouver."

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date.php:168
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Laisser un avis"

#: includes/class-micro-site-care-post-last-updated-date.php:170
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Non, merci"
